    {
      "name": "rig2-empty",
      "do": "shot",
      "look": "farm plot with water and ripe wheat (left), cow pen with 3 cows, iron/coal ore patch, dirt/sand/gravel patch (right); six gated stations; creative-engine charging station in front"
